    EVENT -->|import-complete event| START
    RECORD -->|invoke| LAMBDA
    LAMBDA -->|return Lambda payload| DONE
    LAMBDA -->|write AES-256 audit JSON| AUDIT
    SCOPE -. applies to .-> SFN

